# VICE snapshot location

The play snapshot is a `*.vsf` in the repo root (`C:\dev\Quake64\vice-snapshot-*.vsf`). It is gitignored.

- Find it by listing that directory (`Get-ChildItem *.vsf` or `dir *.vsf` in the root).
- Do not look for it with git (`status`, `ls-files`, `log`). Git will not show it.
- Do not run a workspace-wide or machine-wide file search for it.
